msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/propagated-noise-absorption/extracted-outputs/8c9afe5e-6fa3-427d-a672-becdb14490b8-0.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Twirl the two-qubit gate layers and measurements, and find unique layers {#twirl-the-two-qubit-gate-layers-and-measurements-and-find-unique-layers}"
msgstr "Twirl lapisan get dua-qubit dan pengukuran, serta cari lapisan unik {#twirl-the-two-qubit-gate-layers-and-measurements-and-find-unique-layers}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We use `samplomatic` to box the circuit and identify unique two-qubit layers. A box is a construct that groups instructions together so that specific intents or annotations can later be applied uniformly to all gates within the same box.\n"
msgstr "Kami menggunakan `samplomatic` untuk mengotakkan litar dan mengenal pasti lapisan dua-qubit unik. Kotak ialah konstruk yang mengumpulkan arahan bersama supaya niat atau anotasi tertentu boleh diaplikasikan kemudian secara seragam kepada semua get dalam kotak yang sama.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, we call the method `generate_boxing_pass_manager`, which goes beyond simply identifying two-qubit layers. It performs several key tasks:\n"
msgstr "Di sini, kami memanggil kaedah `generate_boxing_pass_manager`, yang melangkau lebih daripada sekadar mengenal pasti lapisan dua-qubit. Ia melaksanakan beberapa tugas utama:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Groups all two-qubit layers in the circuit,\n"
msgstr "Mengumpulkan semua lapisan dua-qubit dalam litar,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Applies the `Twirl` and `ChangeBasis` annotations to those layers,\n"
msgstr "Mengaplikasikan anotasi `Twirl` dan `ChangeBasis` kepada lapisan tersebut,\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Groups measurement operations into their own boxed sections, and\n"
msgstr "Mengumpulkan operasi pengukuran ke dalam bahagian kotak mereka sendiri, dan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Applies the `InjectNoise` annotation to each two-qubit layer.\n"
msgstr "Mengaplikasikan anotasi `InjectNoise` kepada setiap lapisan dua-qubit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These annotations define how noise, basis changes, and twirling are handled throughout the circuit. They also establish the structure used later for learning and mitigating noise.\n"
msgstr "Anotasi ini menentukan bagaimana hingar, perubahan asas, dan twirling dikendalikan sepanjang litar. Ia juga membentuk struktur yang digunakan kemudian untuk mempelajari dan mengurangkan hingar.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The key configuration options are:\n"
msgstr "Pilihan konfigurasi utama ialah:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`enable_gates`/`enable_measures: True`: Box all two-qubit gate layers and terminal measurements. Single-qubit gates are left-dressed within the boxes.\n"
msgstr "`enable_gates`/`enable_measures: True`: Kotakkan semua lapisan get dua-qubit dan pengukuran terminal. Get satu-qubit dibiarkan berpakaian di sebelah kiri dalam kotak.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`measure_annotations: all`: Include `Twirl` and `ChangeBasis` annotations on the measurement box.\n"
msgstr "`measure_annotations: all`: Sertakan anotasi `Twirl` dan `ChangeBasis` pada kotak pengukuran.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`twirling_strategy: active`: Twirl all active qubits in each box containing entangling gates.\n"
msgstr "`twirling_strategy: active`: Twirl semua qubit aktif dalam setiap kotak yang mengandungi get keterikatan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`inject_noise_targets: gates`: Add `InjectNoise` annotations to all `Twirl`-annotated boxes containing entangling gates.\n"
msgstr "`inject_noise_targets: gates`: Tambah anotasi `InjectNoise` kepada semua kotak beranotasi `Twirl` yang mengandungi get keterikatan.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`inject_noise_strategy: uniform_modification`: Scale all noise layers equivalently across the circuit.\n"
msgstr "`inject_noise_strategy: uniform_modification`: Skalakan semua lapisan hingar secara setara merentas litar.\n"

